sed.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("Your Personal Data must be erased to comply with a legislation or court order.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("\n                      You withdraw your consent for the processing of the Personal Data (and if this is the only basis on\n                      which we are processing your Personal Data).\n                    ")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("\n                      You object to the possession, provided there are no overriding legitimate grounds for continued\n                      processing, or\n                    ")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("You object to processing for direct marketing purposes.")])])])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[t("p",{staticClass:"list-intro"},[e._v("\n                  If we receive your erasure request, we will also take reasonable steps to inform other data controllers\n                  processing the data so they can seek to erase links to or copies of your Personal Data. We may refuse to\n                  act on your request to erase your Personal Data if the processing of your Personal Data is necessary:\n                ")]),e._v(" "),t("ol",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-ol",staticStyle:{"list-style-type":"lower-alpha"}},[t("li",[e._v("To exercise our right of freedom of expression and information.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("To comply with the relevant Nigerian laws and regulations.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("\n                    For the performance of a task carried out in the public interest or to exercise some official authority\n                    vested in us.\n                  ")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("To establish, exercise or defend legal claims.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("To comply with pertinent legal and regulatory directives.")])])]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n                In these cases, we can restrict the processing instead of erasing your Personal Data if requested to do so\n                by you.\n              ")