e._v("\n                  However, we may refuse your request regarding such automated decisions where:\n                ")]),e._v(" "),t("ul",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-ul"},[t("li",[e._v("Necessary to enter into a contract with you, or for the performance of your contract with us.")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("Permitted by regulations, or")]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("Based on your explicit consent.")])])]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[t("span",[e._v("Right to be informed: ")]),e._v("\n                The NDPA requires us, as controllers, to provide certain information to you before processing your personal\n                data. It is in compliance with that obligation that we have published this privacy notice. Additional\n                information are also provided in our Terms of use as well as other notices in our premises when you visit.\n              ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[t("span",[e._v("Withdrawal of consent: ")]),e._v("\n                Your decision to give consent to the processing of your data also comes with a corresponding right to\n                withdraw the consent at any time. Hence, you have the right to communicate to us to stop processing your\n                personal data with ot without reasons and we are duty-bound to stop such processing except other lawful\n                bases exist for us to continue the processing activities.\n              ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[t("span",[e._v("Right to lodge complaint: ")]),e._v("\n                In the unlikely event of an infringement on any of your rights, you are at liberty to lodge complaint to\n                the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC) or any other regulatory agency for redress.\n              ")])])])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-section"},[t("h1",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-h1"},[e._v("10. How Do We Protect Your Personal Data?")]),e._v(" "),t("ol",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-ol"},[t("li",[e._v("\n              Security\n              "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n                We maintain technical, physical, and administrative security measures designed to provide reasonable\n                protection for your Personal Data against loss, misuse, unauthorized access, disclosure, and alteration.\n                The security measures include firewalls, data encryption, physical access controls to our premises, CCTV\n                cameras for public safety and quality control, as well as information access authorization controls.\n              ")])]),e._v(" "),t("li",[e._v("\n              Confidentiality\n              "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n                Your Personal Data is regarded as confidential and will not be divulged to any third party, except under\n                legal and/or regulatory conditions. You have the right to request sight of, and copies of any and all\n                information we keep on you, if such requests are made in compliance with the Freedom of Information Act and\n                other relevant enactments.\n              ")])])]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            While we are dedicated to securing our systems and services and safeguarding the information entrusted to us,\n            your role in fulfilling confidentiality duties includes, but is not limited to, adopting and enforcing\n            appropriate security measures such as securing and maintaining the privacy of your password(s) and\n            account/profile registration information, adherence with physical security protocols on our premises, verifying\n            that the Personal Data we maintain of you is accurate and current.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            We will inform you of any breaches which may likely result in high risks to your rights and freedom.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),t("ol",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-ol"},[t("li",[e._v("\n              Organisational measures\n              "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n                We have drafted policies and other documents that ensure the safety, integrity and confidentiality of your\n                personal data. We also periodically train and equip our authorised staff on the contemporary measures for\n                data security.\n              ")])])])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-section"},[t("h1",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-h1"},[e._v("11. Remedies for Violation and Time-frame for Remedy")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            In the unlikely event of violation of any of your rights a data subject, our Data Protection Officer shall\n            within 30 days of our notice of the said violation, address the issue and redress the violation as practicable\n            as possible. The available remedies include but not limited to correction or deletion of your data, grant of\n            access to your data, due information on the processing of your data, restriction on further processing and\n            other applicable remedies as the relevant laws prescribe.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-section"},[t("h1",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-h1"},[e._v("12. Changes to our Privacy Policy")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            This privacy policy is reviewed periodically and when there is any substantial change to business or regulatory\n            requirements. The revised Privacy Policy will be effective as of the published updated date. At the minimum, we\n            shall review this annually and communicate via our communication channels such as Website, Social Media\n            Accounts etc. If the revised version includes a substantial change, we may notify you of the change using\n            emails or other means.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-section"},[t("h1",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-h1"},[e._v("13. Business Transfers")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            If OPay is involved in a merger, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of all or substantially all of its\n            assets or business, your personal information and any related rights and obligations under this Privacy\n            Policy may be transferred to or assumed by the successor or acquiring entity. We will ensure that any such\n            entity will continue to honor the commitments described in this Privacy Policy with respect to your personal\n            information.\n          ")])]),e._v(" "),t("div",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-section"},[t("h1",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-h1"},[e._v("14. Contact Us")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            If you have any general questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or the way in which we handle your\n            Personal Data, kindly contact us via the details below:\n          ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p",staticStyle:{"font-weight":"600","margin-bottom":"0"}},[e._v("\n            Name: The DPO, OPAY DIGITAL SERVICES LIMITED\n          ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p",staticStyle:{"margin-bottom":"0"}},[e._v("\n            Address: Alexander House, Plot 9, Nurudeen Olowopopo Way, Alausa-Ikeja, Lagos, Nigeria.\n          ")]),e._v(" "),t("p",{staticClass:"terms-privacy-p"},[e._v("\n            Email: "),t("a",{attrs:{href:"mailto:ng-privacy@opay-inc.com"}},[e._v("ng-privacy@opay-inc.com")])])])])])])}],!1,null,"39328474",null);t.default=component.exports;installComponents(component,{TermsPrivacyHeader:o(424).default})}}]);